  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to USAID for the Zimbabwe Youth Works Programme implemented by the International Youth Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Contribution to USAID for the Zimbabwe Youth Works Programme implemented by the International Youth Foundation is a component of Zimbabwe Youth Empowerment Programme (ZYEP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xA3;2,315,339. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
